error: a repeat count must be a `usize`, but this one is `int32`
  --> 010_fill_count_not_usize.cn:11:22
   11 |     let filled = [7; n]
      |                      ^ expected a count of type `usize`
  help: `[v; n]` repeats `v` exactly `n` times, and a count of things is a `usize` here the same way a subscript is. Give `n` type `usize`, or convert it at the literal.

